     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<br><br>I&#39;m trying to deploy an application on <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"><a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363845203000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2FAl_iWrftHC4WUifBbE4u\">shinyapps.io</a></span>, this application generate pptx thanks to <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">ReporteRs</span> package.<br><br>However, while my application runs on my machine (PC/Windows) it fails when I deploy it on <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"><a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363845204000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1-VDX-choPpP2JvLcSMZUS\">shinyapps.io</a></span>. It seems to come from the unavailability of some fonts. Indeed, in some <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">ReporteRs</span> function call, I use two classical fonts (<b>Verdana </b>and <b>Century Gothic</b>) which are available on my machine but not available on <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"><a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363845204000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1-VDX-choPpP2JvLcSMZUS\">shinyapps.io</a></span>.<br><br>To check that I run<br><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">library(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:sans-serif;font-size:13.076923370361328px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;display:inline!important;float:none\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">sysfonts)<br>font.files()</span><br></span><br>both on my machine and on <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"><a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363845204000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1-VDX-choPpP2JvLcSMZUS\">shinyapps.io</a></span><br>On my machine I get 497 fonts, including <b>Verdana </b>for instance<br><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">AGENCYB.TTF AGENCYR.TTF [...] CENTURY.TTF CHILLER.TTF [...] verdana.ttf verdanab.ttf verdanai.ttf verdanaz.ttf [...] WINGDNG3.TTF</span><br><br><br>On  <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"><a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363845204000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1-VDX-choPpP2JvLcSMZUS\">shinyapps.io</a></span> I get only 6 fonts :<br><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">DejaVuSans-Bold.ttf DejaVuSans.ttf DejaVuSansMono-Bold.ttf DejaVuSansMono.ttf DejaVuSerif-Bold.ttf DejaVuSerif.ttf</span><br><br>So my question is, how can I add some (classical) fonts on <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"><a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363845204000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1-VDX-choPpP2JvLcSMZUS\">shinyapps.io</a></span> ?<br><br>Thanks!<br>Dom<br></div>"
